		<unit id="notificationmessage_7">
			<segment>
				<source>CDN delivery is disabled, but the local CSS/JS files are not present in typo3temp/assets/t3sbootstrap/. TYPO3 drops missing files from includeCSS/includeJS without an error, so the frontend may render unstyled. Run the console command "t3sbootstrap:cdnToLocal" (or the scheduler task) to fetch them.</source>
			</segment>
