		<unit id="transfer.title">
			<segment>
				<source>Configuration transfer</source>
			</segment>
		</unit>
		
		<unit id="transfer.description">
			<segment>
				<source>Export the t3sbootstrap configuration of a site root as a portable JSON file and import it into another installation. The export contains no uid and no pid, so the target page tree may look completely different. Site settings (Bootstrap version, Bootswatch, Google Fonts) are not part of it - those live in the site configuration.</source>
			</segment>
		</unit>
		
